                                        <li style="font-weight: normal;">Aptitude tests</li>
                                        <li style="font-weight: normal;">Technical tests</li>
                                        <li style="font-weight: normal;">Soft Skill course</li>
                                        <li style="font-weight: normal;">Guest lectures on career guidance and technical skills</li>
                                   </ul>
                             </li>
